      ],
      "updated": 1779472744885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> In majority of the lang, we have some out of the box library which can help us to \nsetup raw database connection by giving the db connection string and then send\nqueries on top of that conn. \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> In majority of the lang, we have some out of the box library which can help us to \nsetup raw database connection by giving the db connection string and then send\nqueries on top of that conn. \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
