      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779472774554,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JDBC -> Java Database Connectivity \nFoundational library for java apps to connect to databases.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JDBC -> Java Database Connectivity \nFoundational library for java apps to connect to databases.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "O3EczbCPSERGpi_l6zuTF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 235.59970092773438,
      "y": 942.9000015258789,
      "width": 281.73980712890625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 829599733,
      "version": 156,
      "versionNonce": 130296117,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779474121451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "what u do in the app server?\n1. write queries urself.\n2. parse the response urself.\n3. any optimizations\n4. raw queries ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "what u do in the app server?\n1. write queries urself.\n2. parse the response urself.\n3. any optimizations\n4. raw queries ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ur7fBANRp1D6wfmjNnNCR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 799.5997009277344,
      "y": 938.9000015258789,
      "width": 524.5396118164062,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 950677653,
      "version": 216,
      "versionNonce": 1566021685,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779472862947,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "what jdbc does for u?\n1. Given a connection config, it setups the connection\n2. whatever query u wrote, takes that to the db \nand get the response back to u\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "what jdbc does for u?\n1. Given a connection config, it setups the connection\n2. whatever query u wrote, takes that to the db \nand get the response back to u\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "f-WsTuiYOdSpZJmjXbNew",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 225.79971313476562,
      "y": 1098.1000137329102,
      "width": 454.7197265625,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
