      "versionNonce": 731967637,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779474129891,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# Problems with JDBC approach\n1. Lot of repeated code\n2. Repeated Optimizations\n3. Bloated app server code \n4. Manually handle open and closure of db conn\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# Problems with JDBC approach\n1. Lot of repeated code\n2. Repeated Optimizations\n3. Bloated app server code \n4. Manually handle open and closure of db conn\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
