      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779474962009,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ORM | ODM\n\nORM -> object relational mapper\nODM -> object document mapper\n\nwhat is sql ? Sql is a standard (documentation/recommendation) that any query\nlanguage supporting relational databases (in general) should follow.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ORM | ODM\n\nORM -> object relational mapper\nODM -> object document mapper\n\nwhat is sql ? Sql is a standard (documentation/recommendation) that any query\nlanguage supporting relational databases (in general) should follow.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
