      "updated": 1779476102774,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One of the ORM in JAVA -> Hibernate\n\nIn case of complex queries most of the ORM supports to execute raw queries\n\nJava do something better...\n  - Queries -> operate on java objects\n  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "One of the ORM in JAVA -> Hibernate\n\nIn case of complex queries most of the ORM supports to execute raw queries\n\nJava do something better...\n  - Queries -> operate on java objects\n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
