      "updated": 1779476390753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Recommendation/Contract\n\nBridge the gap btw ORMS and Java Object\n\nSet of standard interfaces + annotations\n\nJPQL - \n\nHibernate implements JPA ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Recommendation/Contract\n\nBridge the gap btw ORMS and Java Object\n\nSet of standard interfaces + annotations\n\nJPQL - \n\nHibernate implements JPA ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gbyDb2-hsAtfFr0OVoOTZ",
